riel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"6fvE5PQQ8mldsMDU8IsQSQ","review_id":"0huOhoQZqIEVp6oGRd3gVA","date":"2014-06-22T17:04:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9395960569381714,"text_excerpt":"I like this small place. Mostly seating outside, some bar seating inside. They have sweet and savory waffles. I got the \"sunny in holland\" savory waffle which is 2 fried eggs on a waffle with hollandaise and it was delicious. The waffle is a bit sweet by it went perfect with the eggs and hollandaise. Coffee is really good."},{"business_id":"6fvE5PQQ8mldsMDU8IsQSQ","review_id":"XtZwzexZDueePO23fwh2lA","date":"2020-02-23T00:44:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9348775148391724,"text_excerpt":"I really enjoyed the gluten-free waffles when I visited Waffles on Maple last year. I wasn't impressed by their failure to provide coffee cream and was pleasantly surprised to find they now have real cream instead of only the powdered ick when I was there before. The ladies working on the day I visited were so friendly and helpful. When I had visited before, there was a girl cooking who ignored you when you said hello. There was none of that rudeness this time. The restaurant is small, but it is seriously cute. I do like sitting at the bar which looks out on the bright red property next door. I had the Walking in New Orleans waffle which was my favorite from last time. The pralines on it ..."},{"business_id":"6fvE5PQQ8mldsMDU8IsQSQ","review_id":"rac6vtGvPatVFEnUOKpc6g","date":"2015-06-18T15:43:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9311944842338562,"text_excerpt":"Tiny restaurant, but delicious, with super friendly staff. We were greeted with a sample of their mint frozen lemonade (I forget the name) before we even ordered at the counter. It was good, but being early on a Sunday morning I required caffeine more than lemon and mint. After much debate, the hubby & I decided to split a couple of waffles - one sweet (Elvis, the special of the day) and one savory (heart attack). Best decision ever. Both were amazing. Our daughter had the Uptown Girl and although she couldn't finish it, she enjoyed every bite! Coffees were good too. We each had a cafe au lait. I would definitely return, even though this place is completely out of the way for this westban..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6fvE5PQQ8mldsMDU8IsQSQ","photo_id":"NGCBfFNYgA0zCuVC6Qm1Jg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NGCBfFNYgA0zCuVC6Qm1Jg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9163000583648682},{"business_id":"6fvE5PQQ8mldsMDU8IsQSQ","photo_id":"oKiHjcdFe3OhfNEG6EBw5w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/oKiHjcdFe3OhfNEG6EBw5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9144059419631958},{"business_id":"6fvE5PQQ8mldsMDU8IsQSQ","photo_id":"xG3g9Wb00Ma2aEtPEnKy8A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xG3g9Wb00Ma2aEtPEnKy8A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8853576183319092}]},"notebook_case":null}
